Hi Pierre,

Sorry to bother you again.

I am following the Vignette: Creating binary data files containing copy number estimates (http://www.aroma-project.org/node/88) and <http://www.aroma-project.org/node/88)%20and> trying to create a UGP file. But I am confused with the codes listed:

        units <- c(1,4,7);
        ugp[units,1] <- 1;

        ugp[units,2] <- c(554268, 736483, 757922);
